      "title": "Marginal cost per MWh by plant",
      "description": "(gas + carbon x emissions_factor) / efficiency. EUR per MWh ELECTRICAL out \u2014 a unit cost, not the cost of running the plant, so capacity is not a factor. Both the fuel and the carbon term divide by efficiency: making 1 MWh electrical burns 1/eff MWh thermal, and that burn is what emits. Gas is EUR/MWh thermal on an LHV basis.",
